{
    "prompt": "Write a behavior tree for the robot to execute the command using only available nodes. If object detected, approach and take object, check properties, perform specific task or scan area. list of available nodes: <Action ID = GrabObject    /> <Action ID = ApproachObject    /> <Action ID = ScanArea    /> <Action ID = CheckObjectProperties    /> <SubTree ID = PerformSpecificTask    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectDetected    /> <Condition ID = IsCloseToObject    /> <Condition ID = IsObjectVisible    />",
